    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n80583" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πενθερός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>father-in-law</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				6.170
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				8.582
			</span></i>, Lex Draconisap.<i><span class="en">
				D.
				43.57
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.52
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				369.2
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαβὼν Ἄδραστον
				π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				1302
			</span></i> : in pl., <i>parents-in-law</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				636
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> generally,
				<i>connexion by marriage</i>, e.g. <i>brother-in-law</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>El.</u>
				1286
			</span></i> ; also, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαμβρός</span>
			, <i>son-in-law</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				305
			</span></i> (pl.). (Cf. Skt. <i>bándhus</i> 'kinsman',
			Lith. <i>beñdras</i> 'comrade', Goth. <i>bindan</i>
			'bind'.)</div>
